      "title": {
        "en": "Friendly and highly compassionate team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently commend the practice team, particularly highlighting the front-desk receptionists and attending veterinary surgeons for their polite, reassuring approach. Long-term pet owners appreciate the consistent clinical support and warm welcome on every visit. Reviewers frequently note that staff never pressure them into unnecessary treatments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Calm handling for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently mention how well the clinicians handle stressed cats and fearful dogs. Several reviewers highlight that vaccinations and examinations were carried out with treats and patience, transforming previously traumatic vet visits into calm experiences. Clients express strong confidence leaving their elderly pets and puppies with the clinical team."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 4,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear guidance during regular consultations"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers appreciate the straightforward advice provided by the veterinary surgeons during regular checkups and health assessments. Pet parents highlight that the vets explain examination findings thoroughly and answer questions without rushing. Clients value being given detailed information before deciding on treatment plans for their pets."
      }
    }
  ],
